stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Webhook Event

    Pending --> RateLimitCheck: Process

    RateLimitCheck --> CircuitCheck: Within Limit
    RateLimitCheck --> Queued: Limit Exceeded

    CircuitCheck --> Delivering: Circuit Closed
    CircuitCheck --> Failed: Circuit Open

    Delivering --> Success: HTTP 2xx
    Delivering --> Retry: HTTP 5xx/Timeout
    Delivering --> Failed: HTTP 4xx

    Success --> [*]: Log Success

    Retry --> Attempt1: Retry Count = 0
    Retry --> Attempt2: Retry Count = 1
    Retry --> Attempt3: Retry Count = 2
    Retry --> Attempt4: Retry Count = 3
    Retry --> Attempt5: Retry Count = 4
    Retry --> Attempt6: Retry Count = 5
    Retry --> DeadLetterQueue: Retry Count >= 6

    Attempt1 --> Delivering: Wait 0s (immediate)
    Attempt2 --> Delivering: Wait 1m
    Attempt3 --> Delivering: Wait 5m
    Attempt4 --> Delivering: Wait 30m
    Attempt5 --> Delivering: Wait 2h
    Attempt6 --> Delivering: Wait 6h

    DeadLetterQueue --> [*]: Manual Review Required
    Failed --> [*]: Log Failure
    Queued --> RateLimitCheck: Next Window

    note right of Retry
        Exponential Backoff Strategy
        - Attempt 1: Immediate
        - Attempt 2: 1 minute
        - Attempt 3: 5 minutes
        - Attempt 4: 30 minutes
        - Attempt 5: 2 hours
        - Attempt 6: 6 hours
        Total time: ~8.6 hours
    end note

    note right of CircuitCheck
        Circuit Breaker Rules:
        - Opens after 5 consecutive failures
        - Half-open after 5 minutes
        - Closes after 3 successes
    end note

    note right of DeadLetterQueue
        DLQ entries can be:
        - Manually replayed
        - Bulk replayed
        - Investigated for issues
        - Permanently deleted
    end note
